{"title":"되돌아온 시간 2부(이어지는 시간)","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bDb4vy/hygsXM4l0y/naizs3YwLfIhZwdGikOI4k&filename=th3","synopsis":"내세울 거라고는 비주얼뿐인\n실력 없는 삼류 아이돌 천휘.\n\n어느 날 갑작스런 사고로 죽음을 맞게 되었다.\n\n내가 왜?\n왜 하필이면 나야?\n\n후회가 가득했던 삶.\n만일 다시 한 번 생이 주어진다면\n누구보다 열심히 노력하리라.\n\n그리고 돌아왔다.\n사고 전 가장 막 나가던 시기로.\n\n삼류 아이돌에서 진짜 가수가 되기까지\n아이돌의 인생 역전기가 시작됩니다!\n\n[아이돌물/회귀물]","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":208,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":1904807,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":1905018,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":1905083,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":1905235,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":1905251,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":1905263,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":1905293,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":1905349,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":1905399,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":1905517,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":1905527,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":1905528,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":1905528,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":1905528,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":1905528,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":1905528,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":1905539,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":1905654,"rc":7655,"rs":76147,"cc":1869}]}